 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">복수전공 및 부전공을 포기한 경우 기 취득한 학점은 일반선택학점으로 인정하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">복수전공에서 부전공으로 변경하는 경우에는 부전공학점으로 인정합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp; 다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">졸업 대상자 중에서 복수전공 및 부전공 이수자로 선발 되었으나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이수가 불가능할 경우에는 반드시 이수 포기 신청을 하여야 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp; 라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. 2011</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년도 이후 수강한 복수전공 및 부전공 이수구분은 포기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">변경</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">에 따라 자동 변경됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2010</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년도 이전에 수강한 과목은 이수구분 변경기간에 변경신청하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\